---
// Each block names the module it comes from: nothing here is typed twice.
const blocks = [
  {
    title: "Up next",
    text: "The next sessions, from the official timetable and the team's own schedule. One tap shows the whole timetable, filtered to what concerns them.",
    from: "Timetable",
    href: "/timetable/",
  },
  {
    title: "My role",
    text: "Their role and their car for this event: Race Engineer, #27, Car 27 Crew.",
    from: "Management",
    href: "/management/",
  },
  {
    title: "My accommodation",
    text: "The hotel, who they share the room with, and a link that opens it in maps.",
    from: "Logistics",
    href: "/logistics/",
  },
  {
    title: "Departure and return",
    text: "Flight, train or car, with the tickets and travel documents you attached, ready to open at the gate.",
    from: "Logistics",
    href: "/logistics/",
  },
];
---

<section class="px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
        Their race weekend, on one screen.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        You plan the event once, in the modules you already use. Each crew member opens the event and finds their part of it first: meals and team notes included.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-5">
      {blocks.map((block) => (
        <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-5">
          <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">{block.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-3">{block.text}</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
            From <a href={block.href} class="text-gray-300 underline hover:text-white">{block.from}</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-gray-400">
        When a flight, a room or their timetable changes, the bell in their app says so.{" "}
        They read the plan: <span class="text-white font-medium">it stays yours</span>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
